1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,160
Listen to an announcement in a classroom.

2
00:00:02,160 --> 00:00:08,080
Man: Before we get started, don't forget that the first draft of your research paper is due on Monday.

3
00:00:08,080 --> 00:00:11,020
This draft should include your thesis statement

4
00:00:11,220 --> 00:00:14,080
main arguments, and a preliminary list of sources.

5
00:00:14,080 --> 00:00:18,180
It's only a draft, so it's okay if it's not perfect.

6
00:00:18,180 --> 00:00:21,280
The goal is to get feedback and refine your ideas.

7
00:00:21,280 --> 00:00:27,240
Please submit your draft electronically via the course portal by midnight on Monday.
